# ProFolio
Multi-tenant portfolio platform for any profession. Owners sign up, build a
portfolio, and share a public /[username] page with an AI chatbot that answers
questions about the profile. FREE/PRO tiers, resume parsing, and themes come
after the v1 launch.

## Stack
Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind, PostgreSQL + Prisma,
Server Actions for mutations, Route Handlers for /api/chat, UploadThing for
file uploads (resume, photos).

## Rules
- Server Components by default; add 'use client' only when needed
- Validate all input on the server with zod
- Every write must check the logged-in user owns the record
- Never commit secrets; use .env
- Semantic, accessible HTML
- Explain your plan before making big changes